WEBVTT

00:05:58.398 --> 00:06:00.816
microcontrollers and sensors,

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.694
all in the single body,

00:06:02.718 --> 00:06:06.039
and when you control
individual folding joints,

00:06:06.063 --> 00:06:09.589
you'll be able to achieve
soft motions like that

00:06:09.613 --> 00:06:11.093
upon your command.

00:06:14.013 --> 00:06:18.872
Instead of being a single robot that is
specifically made for a single task,

00:06:18.896 --> 00:06:22.791
robogamis are optimized to do multi-tasks.

00:06:23.366 --> 00:06:25.123
And this is quite important

00:06:25.147 --> 00:06:28.978
for the difficult and unique
environments on the Earth

00:06:29.002 --> 00:06:31.967
as well as in space.